  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-preview.3: page background images (PageBuilder.BackgroundImage with Cover/Contain/Stretch fit and opacity, for letterheads and watermarks) and Document.GenerateImages(dpi) to render pages as PNG. 0.1.0-preview.2: merged cells (MergeCellsHorizontally/Vertically, MergeCells, MergeAndCenter), diagonal cells (WithDiagonalBorder, DiagonalHeaderCell), rounded borders, backgrounds and table outlines, justified text (Justify, HorizontalAlignment.Justify), superscript/subscript, VerticalAlignment.Center (Middle kept as obsolete alias). Licensed under Apache-2.0; third-party components keep their own licenses (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).",
